      "explanation": "Maltose on treatment with dil. HCl gives D-glucose. Hydrolysis of\nmaltose yields two moles of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>- D-glucose. Thus, it is composed of two <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-D-glucose units in\nwhich C-1 of one glucose unit (I) is linked to C-4 of another\nglucose unit (II). The free aldehyde group can be produced at C-1\nof second glucose in solution and it shows reducing properties.\n<br>So, it is a reducing sugar.<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 160 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l2hrpchf/1ae6d4e9-66f0-425d-b59f-1bd6cb12b570/b71d6c30-c643-11ec-ae73-dbe354fcc2f7/file-1l2hrpchg.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">"
